Perhaps the intended workflow: I construct the homepage HTML content myself (since I'm the builder), pass it as htmlContent for validation, and use append-css with the full CSS content to write into assets/css/site.css. The append-css action says "需要追加到首页整体 CSS 的样式" — styles to append to the homepage overall CSS.

