Wait — rule says CSS only uses yb-ai- prefix class selectors (including inside @media), bare element selectors forbidden. So body/html can't be styled directly; use classes. But the page HTML's body element... I can add class="yb-ai-body" to body. Yes, classes on elements are fine, just not bare element selectors in CSS.

